{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "b6f2a1d0-6e2a-4c1a-9a3e-motorcardgame-app",
    "name": "MotorCardGame - app",
    "description": "Requests manuales para probar los endpoints de GameDefinition y GameDefinitionVersion contra una instancia local de app (mvn spring-boot:run -pl backend/app).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{accessToken}}", "type": "string" }]
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8080" },
    { "key": "gameDefinitionId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "versionNumber", "value": "" },
    { "key": "gameInstanceId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "aliceCardId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "aliceSecondCardId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "accessToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "refreshToken", "value": "" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "description": "Todos los requests de este proyecto exigen JWT (Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}) salvo estos, que son los que lo consiguen. La colección hereda auth bearer con {{accessToken}} a nivel raíz, así que en cuanto se ejecuta Register o Login aquí, el resto de carpetas queda autenticado automáticamente.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status is 201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', body.accessToken);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', body.refreshToken);",
                  "pm.test('has user', () => pm.expect(body.user.email).to.be.a('string'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"alice-{{$timestamp}}@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"correct-horse-battery-staple\",\n  \"displayName\": \"Alice\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "auth", "register"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status is 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', body.accessToken);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', body.refreshToken);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"alice-{{$timestamp}}@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"correct-horse-battery-staple\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "auth", "login"] },
            "description": "Usa un email ya registrado (edita el body) — el de la request Register de arriba lleva {{$timestamp}} y cambia en cada ejecución."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Refresh",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status is 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', body.accessToken);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', body.refreshToken);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{refreshToken}}\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/refresh", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "auth", "refresh"] },
            "description": "Rota el refresh token: el usado queda revocado, se guarda el nuevo par."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["pm.test('status is 204', () => pm.response.to.have.status(204));"] }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{refreshToken}}\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "auth", "logout"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "[Error] Login - 401 credenciales incorrectas",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["pm.test('status is 401', () => pm.response.to.have.status(401));"] }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"no-existe@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"lo-que-sea\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "auth", "login"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "[Error] Register - 409 email duplicado",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["pm.test('status is 409', () => pm.response.to.have.status(409));"] }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"duplicado-fijo@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"correct-horse-battery-staple\",\n  \"displayName\": \"Duplicado\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "auth", "register"] },
            "description": "Ejecutar esta request DOS veces seguidas: la primera crea (201), la segunda choca con el email fijo (409)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "[Error] Protected endpoint - 401 sin token",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["pm.test('status is 401', () => pm.response.to.have.status(401));"] }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/game-definitions", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "game-definitions"] },
            "description": "Sin cabecera Authorization, cualquier endpoint fuera de /api/auth/** devuelve 401."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
